#   /Users/cbivins/Desktop/Finished_Projects/Oak_Endophyte_Project_NEATEST/NEW/beta_diversity_revised/Rarefied
#
# Important:
#   - This script uses base R column subsetting throughout.
#   - The rarefied OTU table is in raw counts, so it is converted to relative
